{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/1ff35ff5b38da4696c3218a067f82d91.avif?t=1772835979\" width=1162 height=591 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few Shall Return is a multiplayer dungeon extraction game with very short rounds, made by a small indie team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bite-sized RPG experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts <strong>7 minutes and a half</strong>, delivering a full RPG experience in a short session. No grinding, no waiting, just action, strategy, and high-stakes decisions. There can be up to 8 players in a private or public game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/2c66412a2c2fa05eee78b10d64e3c503.poster.avif?t=1772835979\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/2c66412a2c2fa05eee78b10d64e3c503.webm?t=1772835979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/2c66412a2c2fa05eee78b10d64e3c503.mp4?t=1772835979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classes &amp; Play Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either <strong>Molokhia</strong>,\u00a0a crusader chef who can heal or poison the others with pie. He is built like a tank, has a lot of inventory space, but he's quite slow...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or<strong>, Sprout</strong>,\u00a0a ranged gambler who can gamble Unrefined Corium to spawn weapons or, on a bad roll, an enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprout is quick and nimble but they cannot carry too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More characters coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/07b618dd14083ed9a38508e89f81dc56.avif?t=1772835979\" width=1560 height=1063 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extraction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few will make it out: for every player who dies, one other player can escape. You have to work together to fight enemies and solve puzzles, but when the exit opens, it\u2019s every player for themselves. Bring whatever equipment you want to increase you chances but if you die, you lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/6e98e47625d058b03076f8e67d3df6a7.poster.avif?t=1772835979\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/6e98e47625d058b03076f8e67d3df6a7.webm?t=1772835979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/6e98e47625d058b03076f8e67d3df6a7.mp4?t=1772835979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Tradeoffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory space is extremely limited! Choose what to bring in and what to take out. Weapons, potions, keys, or treasure\u2014you can\u2019t carry everything. Make every item count because you only keep what you bring out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/1718240da6106f223bc3e4eaca30dbba.poster.avif?t=1772835979\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/1718240da6106f223bc3e4eaca30dbba.webm?t=1772835979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/1718240da6106f223bc3e4eaca30dbba.mp4?t=1772835979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And more!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite maps</strong> (procedurally generated)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of equipment</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377400?t=1772835979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/69bb6802538fc64b9a75c890367a2b92ae20bb18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772835979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/2b568f8a7ffec1eb70b7674f2d82e83e30d91ffa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772835979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/2b568f8a7ffec1eb70b7674f2d82e83e30d91ffa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772835979","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains fantasy violence where you fight other players and enemies in a dungeon."},"demos":[{"appid":3970740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377400/extras/1ff35ff5b38da4696c3218a067f82d91.avif?t=1772835979\" width=1162 height=591 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few Shall Return is a multiplaye